е предупреждения Vite о крупных чанках' '- `PLAYWRIGHT_PORT=3018 npm run test:e2e` - 24 tests passed during initial implementation' '' '## Скриншот' '![Directory admin workspace](https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/blob/issue-23-5dd953aa8c1c/docs/screenshots/dir-admin-workspace.png?raw=true)')\"","workdir":"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1778419809418","yield_time_ms":1000,"max_output_tokens":12000} thread_id=019e122f-ee66-7f30-b159-6f1cfd807d4a
